{"seq":4,"slug":"performance-tuning","title":"性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/performance-tuning","wordCount":747,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能调优\">性能调优</h1><h2 id=\"git-性能瓶颈\">Git 性能瓶颈</h2><p>大型仓库（文件数超过 10 万或历史超过 10 万 commit）中，常见的性能瓶颈包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>影响操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>index 文件过大</td>\n<td>status/add 变慢</td>\n<td>日常开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pack 文件碎片</td>\n<td>clone/fetch 变慢</td>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>松散对象过多</td>\n<td>磁盘占用膨胀</td>\n<td>存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作目录文件多</td>\n<td>checkout/status 变慢</td>\n<td>分支切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史过深</td>\n<td>log/blame 变慢</td>\n<td>历史查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git count-objects -vH&#10;&#10;time git status&#10;&#10;git rev-list --count HEAD&#10;find . -not -path &#39;./.git/*&#39; -type f | wc -l\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> count-objects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -vH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> git status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rev-list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --count</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './.git/*'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Git 性能调优围绕几个可缓存的中间结构展开，把它们维护好就能显著提速：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Index</td>\n<td>工作区文件状态快照，越大越慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fsmonitor</td>\n<td>借助系统文件事件避免全目录扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GC / Repack</td>\n<td>压缩松散对象、合并碎片 Pack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Commit Graph</td>\n<td>预计算的提交元数据缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maintenance</td>\n<td>Git 2.29+ 的自动后台维护机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fewFiles 开关</td>\n<td>feature.manyFiles 一键开启大仓库优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"index-优化\">Index 优化</h2><p><strong>Index（索引）</strong> 文件（<code>.git/index</code>）记录了工作目录中所有跟踪文件的状态。文件越多，index 读写越慢。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ls -lh .git/index&#10;&#10;git update-index --index-version 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -lh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update-index</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --index-version</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Index 版本</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>v2</td>\n<td>默认版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v3</td>\n<td>支持扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v4</td>\n<td>路径名前缀压缩，更小更快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fsmonitor-文件系统监控\">Fsmonitor 文件系统监控</h2><p><strong>Fsmonitor</strong> 使用操作系统的文件系统事件通知（如 macOS 的 FSEvents、Linux 的 inotify）来加速 <code>git status</code>，避免遍历整个工作目录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config core.fsmonitor true&#10;git config core.untrackedcache true&#10;&#10;brew install watchman&#10;git config core.fsmonitor &quot;$(which watchman)&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.fsmonitor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.untrackedcache</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> watchman</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.fsmonitor</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">which</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> watchman)\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>core.fsmonitor</code></td>\n<td>启用文件系统监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>core.untrackedcache</code></td>\n<td>缓存未跟踪文件列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>feature.manyFiles</code></td>\n<td>一键开启大仓库优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config feature.manyFiles true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature.manyFiles</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>feature.manyFiles</code> 是 Git 提供的大仓库一键优化开关，会自动启用 fsmonitor、untrackedcache 等性能特性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gc-与-pack-优化\">GC 与 Pack 优化</h2><p><strong>git gc（Garbage Collection）</strong> 清理不可达对象、压缩松散对象为 Pack 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git gc&#10;git gc --aggressive&#10;git gc --auto&#10;&#10;git config gc.auto 256&#10;git config gc.autoPackLimit 50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --aggressive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc.auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc.autoPackLimit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[松散对象] --&gt;|git gc| B[Pack 文件]&#10;    C[不可达对象] --&gt;|gc prune| D[删除]&#10;    E[碎片 Pack] --&gt;|gc repack| F[合并优化]\">graph LR\n    A[松散对象] --&gt;|git gc| B[Pack 文件]\n    C[不可达对象] --&gt;|gc prune| D[删除]\n    E[碎片 Pack] --&gt;|gc repack| F[合并优化]</pre><p>Pack 文件手动优化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git repack -a -d -f --depth=250 --window=250&#10;&#10;git prune&#10;&#10;git maintenance start\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth=250</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --window=250</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>git gc</code></td>\n<td>标准垃圾回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git gc --aggressive</code></td>\n<td>深度优化（耗时较长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git repack</code></td>\n<td>重新打包对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git prune</code></td>\n<td>删除不可达的松散对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git maintenance</code></td>\n<td>后台自动维护（Git 2.29+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-maintenance-自动维护\">Git Maintenance 自动维护</h2><p>Git 2.29+ 引入了 <strong>maintenance</strong> 命令，自动化后台维护任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git maintenance start&#10;&#10;git maintenance run --task=gc&#10;git maintenance run --task=commit-graph&#10;git maintenance run --task=prefetch\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --task=gc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --task=commit-graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --task=prefetch</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>commit-graph</td>\n<td>每小时</td>\n<td>更新 commit 图缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prefetch</td>\n<td>每小时</td>\n<td>预拉取远程数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loose-objects</td>\n<td>每天</td>\n<td>清理松散对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>incremental-repack</td>\n<td>每天</td>\n<td>增量重打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gc</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>完整垃圾回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"commit-graph-加速\">Commit Graph 加速</h2><p><strong>Commit Graph</strong> 是一个预计算的 commit 元数据缓存，显著加速 <code>git log</code>、<code>git merge-base</code> 等操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit-graph write --reachable&#10;&#10;git config core.commitGraph true&#10;&#10;git commit-graph verify\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit-graph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --reachable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.commitGraph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit-graph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verify</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>有无 Commit Graph</th>\n<th>git log --oneline (10万+提交)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>数秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"大仓库配置模板\">大仓库配置模板</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config core.fsmonitor true&#10;git config core.untrackedcache true&#10;git config core.commitGraph true&#10;git config gc.auto 256&#10;git config fetch.writeCommitGraph true&#10;git config feature.manyFiles true&#10;&#10;git maintenance start\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.fsmonitor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.untrackedcache</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.commitGraph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc.auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch.writeCommitGraph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature.manyFiles</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> maintenance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[大仓库性能调优] --&gt; B[Index 优化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Fsmonitor]&#10;    A --&gt; D[GC 与 Pack]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Commit Graph]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Maintenance]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[v4 索引格式]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[watchman / 内置]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[repack / prune]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[预计算缓存]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[自动后台维护]\">graph TD\n    A[大仓库性能调优] --&gt; B[Index 优化]\n    A --&gt; C[Fsmonitor]\n    A --&gt; D[GC 与 Pack]\n    A --&gt; E[Commit Graph]\n    A --&gt; F[Maintenance]\n    B --&gt; B1[v4 索引格式]\n    C --&gt; C1[watchman / 内置]\n    D --&gt; D1[repack / prune]\n    E --&gt; E1[预计算缓存]\n    F --&gt; F1[自动后台维护]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能诊断\">性能诊断</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"GIT_TRACE2_PERF=1 git status 2&gt;&amp;1 | head -50&#10;&#10;git status --porcelain=v2&#10;&#10;time git log --oneline -1000 &gt; /dev/null&#10;&#10;git sizer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GIT_TRACE2_PERF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --porcelain=v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> git log --oneline -1000 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /dev/null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sizer</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/命令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>GIT_TRACE2_PERF</code></td>\n<td>输出详细的性能追踪日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git sizer</code></td>\n<td>分析仓库规模和瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git count-objects -vH</code></td>\n<td>查看对象统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>time git &lt;command&gt;</code></td>\n<td>测量命令执行时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((性能调优))&#10;    Index&#10;      v4 格式&#10;      untrackedcache&#10;    Fsmonitor&#10;      watchman&#10;      feature.manyFiles&#10;    GC 与 Pack&#10;      gc / repack&#10;      maintenance&#10;    Commit Graph&#10;      预计算缓存&#10;      log 加速&#10;    诊断&#10;      GIT_TRACE2_PERF&#10;      git sizer\">mindmap\n  root((性能调优))\n    Index\n      v4 格式\n      untrackedcache\n    Fsmonitor\n      watchman\n      feature.manyFiles\n    GC 与 Pack\n      gc / repack\n      maintenance\n    Commit Graph\n      预计算缓存\n      log 加速\n    诊断\n      GIT_TRACE2_PERF\n      git sizer</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Index v4</strong> 和 <strong>untrackedcache</strong> 加速工作目录状态检查</li>\n<li><strong>Fsmonitor</strong> 利用系统文件事件通知避免全目录扫描，是大仓库 <code>git status</code> 的关键优化</li>\n<li><strong>git gc</strong> 和 <strong>repack</strong> 压缩对象，<strong>maintenance</strong> 实现自动化后台维护</li>\n<li><strong>Commit Graph</strong> 预计算提交元数据，将 log 和 merge-base 操作加速到毫秒级</li>\n<li>使用 <code>feature.manyFiles=true</code> 一键开启大仓库优化，配合 <code>git maintenance start</code> 实现自动维护</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能调优","id":"性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"Git 性能瓶颈","id":"git-性能瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Index 优化","id":"index-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Fsmonitor 文件系统监控","id":"fsmonitor-文件系统监控"},{"level":2,"text":"GC 与 Pack 优化","id":"gc-与-pack-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Maintenance 自动维护","id":"git-maintenance-自动维护"},{"level":2,"text":"Commit Graph 加速","id":"commit-graph-加速"},{"level":2,"text":"大仓库配置模板","id":"大仓库配置模板"},{"level":2,"text":"性能诊断","id":"性能诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Git Hooks 钩子机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/git-hooks"},"next":{"title":"GitHub Actions 持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/github-actions"}}